notes={'asset':'rock-shelf-end','round':'round-01','change':['Re-proportioned interior to finite original .34 reach while preserving actual saved W[-.5,-.44] field.','Constructed .085 native seven-segment rounding over 5 upper closed-end edges, stopping above exact rectangular ground support.','Two embedded lavender/teal stones support major fitted stone surfaces. Original scratch boxes/end stripe omitted.'],'nativeFacts':{'bounds':native['bounds'],'groundArea':native['finiteGround']['actualProjectedArea'],'maxWestNormalError':native['westField']['maxCornerNormalComponentError'],'materialGraphsEqual':native['westField']['materialGraphsEqual']},'evidenceLimits':['Connected and independent consumer comparison reports finite area-light/source-extent RGB differences and boundary antialias differences separately. No local visible seam waiver.','fullChrome and shell native canvases are pixel-identical; their CSS screenshots differ and both full image sets require actual judge inspection.','The unrelated CUA Mac-lock diagnostic resulted from a discarded desktop interpretation; both requested headless modes completed.'],'verdict':'Pending root packet seal and original independent judge. No family or production approval.'};(D/'notes-round-01.json').write_text(json.dumps(notes,indent=2)+'\n')
